'''Cheesy''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
Its blade and guard are yellow with a few small holes in them, resembling swiss cheese, hence the name. The handle is solid black. 
== Trivia ==
* It has a partner gun under the name [[Cheddar]].

